# Tag management workflow

`pebbles tag add <id> <tag...>` appends and deduplicates tags on one
issue; `pebbles tag remove <id> <tag...>` removes them. `pebbles list
--tag <tag>` filters by tag (repeatable, AND) and composes with
--status, --issue-type, and --search. Tags are trimmed on entry and
matched exactly (case-sensitive).

Fixture store: 111 (Login button..., todo bug), 222 (JWT token
authentication system, todo design), 333 (User can login..., in
progress usecase), 444 (Export users to CSV, done usecase). All
untagged initially.

## Baseline list (updated_at descending)

```console
$ pebbles list
111 [bug] [TODO] Login button doesn't respond on mobile
222 [des] [TODO] JWT token authentication system
333 [uc] [IN PROGRESS] User can login with email and password
444 [uc] [DONE] Export users to CSV

```

