## Filter by tag

```console
$ pebbles list --tag mobile
111 [bug] [TODO] Login button doesn't respond on mobile

```

```console
$ pebbles list --tag backend
222 [des] [TODO] JWT token authentication system

```

```console
$ pebbles tag add 33333333 backend
✓ Added tags: backend
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
ID: 33333333-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
