```

## Tag filter orders by updated_at (newest first)

```console
$ pebbles list --tag backend
333 [uc] [IN PROGRESS] User can login with email and password
222 [des] [TODO] JWT token authentication system

```

## Tag filter composes with --status

```console
$ pebbles list --tag backend --status todo
222 [des] [TODO] JWT token authentication system

```

## Tag filter composes with --search

```console
$ pebbles list --tag backend --search jwt
222 [des] [TODO] JWT token authentication system

```

## Repeatable --tag is AND (issue must carry every tag)

```console
$ pebbles list --tag mobile --tag backend
No issues found.

```

## Adding an existing tag is a no-op

```console
$ pebbles tag add 11111111 mobile
No changes: issue already has these tags

```

## Remove a tag

```console
$ pebbles tag remove 11111111 frontend
✓ Removed tags: frontend
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
