## Removing an absent tag is a no-op

```console
$ pebbles tag remove 11111111 frontend
No changes: issue does not have these tags

```

## Duplicate tags in one add command are added once

```console
$ pebbles tag add 44444444 urgent urgent
✓ Added tags: urgent
