## Empty tags are rejected

```console
$ pebbles tag add 11111111 ""
? failed
Error: Tag cannot be empty (got "")

```

## An empty --tag filter is rejected

```console
$ pebbles list --tag ""
? failed
Error: Tag filter cannot be empty

```

## Unknown issue IDs fail with the standard error

```console
$ pebbles tag add 99999999 x
? failed
Error: No issue found with ID starting with '99999999'

```

## Tag matching is case-sensitive

```console
$ pebbles list --tag Mobile
No issues found.

```

## No match

```console
$ pebbles list --tag doesntexist
No issues found.

```
